WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.175
Nigel Wright, the Prime Minister's Chief of Staff, wrote a personal cheque for ninety thousand dollars to cover Duffy's expenses.

00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:17.325
While he categorized it as an act of public duty, the system's reliance on backroom payouts rather than transparent accountability remains striking.
